You gain the Rank {c_random}22{/c} passive of Druid's {c_important}Cyclone Armor{/c}. 
Close enemies are {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c} and take {c_random}125%[x]{/c} more damage from you.{/c}{/c}

{c_unique}消灭敌人时有 {c_number}50%{/c} 几率释放一个 {c_random}20{/c} 级巫师的{c_important}连锁闪电{/c}。
你获得德鲁伊{c_important}旋风甲{/c}的 {c_random}22{/c} 级被动效果。
近距敌人陷入{c_important}{u}易伤{/u}{/c}状态，受到来自你的伤害提高 {c_random}125%[x]{/c}。{/c}{/c}

{c_unique}Dealing direct damage grants {c_random}[0.80 - 1.00]%[x]{/c} increased Critical Strike Damage for each enemy hit within {c_number}10{/c} seconds, up to {c_random}[40 - 50]%[x]{/c}.

At Maximum you gain:

{c_label}Lucky Hit:{/c} Critical Strikes have up to a {c_number}50%{/c} chance to deal double damage, Heal for {c_random}[130 - 150]{/c} Life, and refresh the duration of the bonus.{/c}

{c_unique}造成直接伤害时，{c_number}10{/c} 秒内每击中一个敌人，暴击伤害提高 {c_random}[0.80 - 1.00]%[x]{/c}，最多提高 {c_random}[40 - 50]%[x]{/c}。

达到最大值时，你将获得:

{c_label}幸运一击:{/c} 暴击有最高 {c_number}50%{/c} 几率造成双倍伤害，治疗 {c_random}[130 - 150]{/c} 点生命值，并刷新加成持续时间。{/c}

{c_unique}{c_label}Lucky Hit:{/c} Dealing damage to an enemy affected by a {c_important}Trap{/c} Skill has up to a {c_number}40%{/c} chance to:
{icon:bullet,1.2} Reduce the active Cooldowns of your {c_important}Trap{/c} Skills by {c_number}30%{/c}
{icon:bullet,1.2} Increase your {c_important}Trap{/c} Skill damage by {c_random}[9.0 - 12.0]%[x]{/c} for {c_number}10{/c} seconds, up to {c_number}[45 - 60]%[x]{/c}{/c}

{c_unique}{c_label}幸运一击:{/c} 对受到{c_important}陷阱{/c}技能影响的敌人造成伤害时，最多有 {c_number}40%{/c} 几率:
{icon:bullet,1.2} 使你{c_important}陷阱{/c}技能的当前冷却时间缩短 {c_number}30%{/c} 
{icon:bullet,1.2} 使你的{c_important}陷阱{/c}技能伤害提高 {c_random}[9.0 - 12.0]%[x]{/c}，持续 {c_number}10{/c} 秒，最多可达 {c_number}[45 - 60]%[x]{/c}{/c}

{c_unique}受到{c_important}怒吼{/c}技能效果影响时，获得:
• 所有技能等级 {c_random}+5{/c}
• 生命上限 {c_random}+15%[+]{/c}
• 主要资源上限 {c_random}+15%[x]{/c}{/c}{/c}

